  "description": "Built from the DNA of our Griffin PRO and developed for riders who think bigger is always better, the Cronus Complete is our ultimate 26\" dirt jump and slopestyle machine. Featuring the same aftermarket 6061-T6 aluminium frame with aggressive geometry and uncompromising strength, it's designed to handle the biggest tricks and most demanding lines with confidence.\nTwist-resistant box chainstays, a custom yoke for maximum clearance, and a gyro-ready head tube provide the control and versatility modern riders demand, while an RST 100mm fork, Race Face cockpit and drivetrain components, and Maxxis DTH 2.3\" tires deliver a premium ride straight out of the box.\nDialled from top to bottom, the Cronus Complete is built to send it bigger, higher, and further than ever before.",
